graph TD
    User([User Request / Task]) --> AgentCore[Agentic Orchestrator & Reasoning Core]
    
    subgraph Reasoning & Planning Loop
        AgentCore --> Thought[1. Autonomous Thought & Plan]
        Thought --> ToolSelection[2. Tool Selection & Execution]
        ToolSelection --> Observation[3. Tool Observation & Analysis]
        Observation --> Reflection[4. Self-Reflection & Evaluation]
        Reflection -->|Needs Correction / Refinement| Thought
        Reflection -->|Validated & Grounded| FinalOutput[5. Formulate Final Response]
    end

    subgraph Tool Calling Suite
        ToolSelection -.-> ToolRAG[Tool: RAG Knowledge Retrieval]
        ToolSelection -.-> ToolInspect[Tool: File & Repo Inspector]
        ToolSelection -.-> ToolEval[Tool: Self-Critique & Metrics Evaluator]
        ToolSelection -.-> ToolSocial[Tool: Autonomous Social Post Generator]
    end

    subgraph Data & Storage
        ToolRAG --> VectorDB[(ChromaDB / Vector Store)]
        ToolInspect --> RepoFiles[(Local Codebase & Documents)]
    end

    FinalOutput --> Deliverables([Task Solution + Autonomous LinkedIn Post])
